    "https://www.cam.ac.uk/jobs/browse-our-vacancies/research-vacancies/working-as-a-researcher-at-cambridge": {
      "title": "Working as a researcher",
      "description": "Working as a researcher at Cambridge | University of Cambridge Sorry, you need to enable JavaScript to visit this website. Your cookie choices We use necessary cookies to make our site work. If you choose to accept optional cookies, it will help us understand your needs better and personalise what you see. Accept all cookies Decline optional cookies Choose your cookie mix Skip to main content View menu Study at Cambridge About the University Research at Cambridge Quick links For Cambridge students For staff For alumni For our\n              researchers Business and\n              enterprise Colleges and\n              Departments Give to Cambridge Libraries Museums and collections For Cambridge students For staff For alumni For our\n              researchers Business and\n              enterprise Colleges and\n              Departments Give to Cambridge Libraries Museums and collections For Cambridge students For staff For alumni For our researchers Business and enterprise Colleges and Departments Give to Cambridge Libraries Museums and collections Search Search site Home Study at Cambridge Undergraduate Undergraduate courses Applying Events and open days Fees and finance Postgraduate Postgraduate courses How to apply Postgraduate events Fees and funding International\n                students Continuing education Lifelong learning Courses in education Close About the University How the\n                University and Colleges work Term dates and calendars History Map Visiting the University News Annual reports A global university Equality and diversity Events Public engagement Jobs Give to Cambridge Close Research at Cambridge Close For Cambridge students For staff For alumni For our researchers Business and enterprise Colleges and Departments Give to Cambridge Libraries Museums and collections Breadcrumb Home Jobs Browse our vacancies Working as a researcher at Cambridge Jobs Menu Section - Jobs Jobs home Why Cambridge? Back to section home Why Cambridge? Why Cambridge? overview Pay and reward and employee benefits How to apply Back to section home How to apply How to apply overview Finding a role and applying online Inclusive recruitment Application tips Manage my applications Contact us Browse our vacancies Back to section home Browse our vacancies Browse our vacancies overview Academic vacancies Back to section home Academic vacancies Working as an academic at Cambridge Professional services vacancies Back to section home Professional services vacancies Working in professional services roles in Cambridge Professorships and Directorships vacancies Research vacancies Back to section home Research vacancies Working as a researcher at Cambridge Studentships Temporary employment service Search all University jobs College and affiliated institution jobs Life in Cambridge Back to section home Life in Cambridge Life in Cambridge overview Community and surroundings Getting around Relocating to Cambridge Back to section home Relocating to Cambridge Relocating to Cambridge overview Visas and immigration Right to work in the UK Accommodation and relocation support Search all University jobs Working as a researcher at Cambridge Section - Jobs Browse our vacancies Academic vacancies Professional services vacancies Professorships and Directorships vacancies Research vacancies Working as a researcher at Cambridge Studentships Temporary employment service Search all University jobs College and affiliated institution jobs Jobs home Why Cambridge? How to apply Life in Cambridge Relocating to Cambridge Search all University jobs What's the research culture like at the University of Cambridge? At the University of Cambridge, we’re at the forefront of global research. Renowned for our pioneering contributions across disciplines, we aim to foster a vibrant research environment that blends tradition with innovation. Researchers here are empowered by a culture of intellectual freedom, interdisciplinary collaboration, and access to world-class facilities. Scholars here are free to pursue transformative ideas and tackle some of the most pressing challenges of our time. Our researchers are driving breakthroughs in cancer care, highlighting the university’s powerful blend of clinical expertise and cutting-edge science. They’re leading bold, interdisciplinary projects in the fields of technology and sustainability – from engineering programmable plants to advancing robotics through major national initiatives. It’s a place where world-changing ideas are not only imagined – they’re realised. At Cambridge, you can become part of a dynamic, supportive community that values curiosity, creativity, and collaboration. We’re right at the centre of UK innovation, connecting academia, industry, and policy. It’s an inspiring environment where researchers at every stage can thrive and make a lasting difference. As a researcher at Cambridge, you can: Participate in our new annual Academic Career Pathways (Research) promotions scheme, offering progression to more senior research roles. Apply for pay progression within your current band, through our termly Researcher Contribution Increment scheme. Get support from the University’s Postdoc Academy, who enable our Postdocs to realise their potential through information, community, advocacy and professional development. View current researcher vacancies Connect with us Facebook Instagram LinkedIn X YouTube © 2026 University of Cambridge Contact the University Accessibility Freedom of information Privacy policy and cookies Statement on Modern Slavery Terms and conditions University A-Z Study at Cambridge Undergraduate Postgraduate Lifelong learning Courses in education About the University How the University\n              and Colleges work Give to Cambridge Jobs Map Visiting the University Cambridge University Press & Assessment Research at Cambridge Research news About research at Cambridge Public engagement"
    },
