eward and employee benefits How to apply Back to section home How to apply How to apply overview Finding a role and applying online Inclusive recruitment Application tips Manage my applications Contact us Browse our vacancies Back to section home Browse our vacancies Browse our vacancies overview Academic vacancies Back to section home Academic vacancies Working as an academic at Cambridge Professional services vacancies Back to section home Professional services vacancies Working in professional services roles in Cambridge Professorships and Directorships vacancies Research vacancies Back to section home Research vacancies Working as a researcher at Cambridge Studentships Temporary employment service Search all University jobs College and affiliated institution jobs Life in Cambridge Back to section home Life in Cambridge Life in Cambridge overview Community and surroundings Getting around Relocating to Cambridge Back to section home Relocating to Cambridge Relocating to Cambridge overview Visas and immigration Right to work in the UK Accommodation and relocation support Search all University jobs Relocating to Cambridge Section - Jobs Relocating to Cambridge Visas and immigration Right to work in the UK Accommodation and relocation support Jobs home Why Cambridge? How to apply Browse our vacancies Life in Cambridge Search all University jobs Our diverse workforce is made up of experts from all over the world. We currently employ about 13,500 staff, 30% of whom are from an international background. Together, they form a thriving international community across our 31 Colleges and 150 departments and institutions. We welcome talent from across the globe, so whether you’re thinking of joining us from overseas or are relocating from elsewhere in the UK, we have a variety of provisions to help you settle in as easily as possible. Learn more Visas and immigration Right to work in the UK Accommodation and relocation support Connect with us Facebook Instagram LinkedIn X Yo