Department/location University of Cambridge Institute of Professional and Continuing Education Salary £33,951-£39,906 Category Professional services Posted 25 August 2026 Closes 18 September 2026 Reference EA50845 Title\n  \n    Sort descending Marketing Manager (Better Futures) Department/location University of Cambridge Institute of Professional and Continuing Education Salary £35,608-£46,049 pro rata Category Professional services Posted 13 August 2026 Closes 3 September 2026 Reference EA50737 Title\n  \n    Sort descending Visual Content Creator Department/location University of Cambridge Institute of Professional and Continuing Education Salary £31,236-£35,608 Category Professional services Posted 9 July 2026 Closes 8 September 2026 Reference EA50335 Connect with us Facebook Instagram LinkedIn X YouTube © 2026 University of Cambridge Contact the University Accessibility Freedom of information Privacy policy and cookies Statement on Modern Slavery Terms and conditions University A-Z Study at Cambridge Undergraduate Postgraduate Lifelong learning Courses in education About the University How the University\n              and Colleges work Give to Cambridge Jobs Map Visiting the University Cambridge University Press & Assessment Research at Cambridge Research news About research at Cambridge Public engagement"
