idge? overview Pay and reward and employee benefits How to apply Back to section home How to apply How to apply overview Finding a role and applying online Inclusive recruitment Application tips Manage my applications Contact us Browse our vacancies Back to section home Browse our vacancies Browse our vacancies overview Academic vacancies Back to section home Academic vacancies Working as an academic at Cambridge Professional services vacancies Back to section home Professional services vacancies Working in professional services roles in Cambridge Professorships and Directorships vacancies Research vacancies Back to section home Research vacancies Working as a researcher at Cambridge Studentships Temporary employment service Search all University jobs College and affiliated institution jobs Life in Cambridge Back to section home Life in Cambridge Life in Cambridge overview Community and surroundings Getting around Relocating to Cambridge Back to section home Relocating to Cambridge Relocating to Cambridge overview Visas and immigration Right to work in the UK Accommodation and relocation support Search all University jobs University of Cambridge Development and Alumni Relations vacancies Academic vacancies | Research vacancies | Professional services vacancies | Professorships and Directorships | Studentships | College and affiliated institutions vacancies Found 3 vacancies Search these jobs Hide lower priority columns Title\n  \n    Sort descending Title Sort descending Department/location Department/location Salary Salary Category Category Posted Posted Closes Closes Reference Reference Title\n  \n    Sort descending Associate Director, Physical Sciences (Permanent and Maternity Cover) Department/location University of Cambridge Development and Alumni Relations Salary £47,389-£59,966 Category Professional services Posted 11 August 2026 Closes 6 September 2026 Reference DH50680 Title\n  \n    Sort descending Fundraising Assistant Department/location University of C