oyee benefits How to apply Back to section home How to apply How to apply overview Finding a role and applying online Inclusive recruitment Application tips Manage my applications Contact us Browse our vacancies Back to section home Browse our vacancies Browse our vacancies overview Academic vacancies Back to section home Academic vacancies Working as an academic at Cambridge Professional services vacancies Back to section home Professional services vacancies Working in professional services roles in Cambridge Professorships and Directorships vacancies Research vacancies Back to section home Research vacancies Working as a researcher at Cambridge Studentships Temporary employment service Search all University jobs College and affiliated institution jobs Life in Cambridge Back to section home Life in Cambridge Life in Cambridge overview Community and surroundings Getting around Relocating to Cambridge Back to section home Relocating to Cambridge Relocating to Cambridge overview Visas and immigration Right to work in the UK Accommodation and relocation support Search all University jobs Faculty of History vacancies Academic vacancies | Research vacancies | Professional services vacancies | Professorships and Directorships | Studentships | College and affiliated institutions vacancies Found 2 vacancies Search these jobs Hide lower priority columns Title\n  \n    Sort descending Title Sort descending Department/location Department/location Salary Salary Category Category Posted Posted Closes Closes Reference Reference Title\n  \n    Sort descending Isaac Newton Trust and Sir John Plumb Academic Career Development Fellowship in Latin American History (Fixed Term) Department/location Faculty of History Salary £37,694-£46,049 Category Research Posted 28 August 2026 Closes 30 September 2026 Reference JJ50893 Title\n  \n    Sort descending Project Coordinator 0.6FTE (Part Time, Fixed Term) Department/location Faculty of History Salary £33,951-£39,906 pro rata Category Professional services Posted 25 August 2026 Closes 13 September 2026 Reference JJ50860 Connect with us Facebook Instagram LinkedIn X YouTube © 2026 University of Cambridge Contact the University Accessibility Freedom of information Privacy policy and cookies Statement on Modern Slavery Terms and conditions University A-Z Study at Cambridge Undergraduate Postgraduate Lifelong learning Courses in education About the University How the University\n              and Colleges work Give to Cambridge Jobs Map Visiting the University Cambridge University Press & Assessment Research at Cambridge Research news About research at Cambridge Public engagement"
