    "https://www.cam.ac.uk/jobs/senior-service-manager-internal-applicants-only-ba50487": {
      "title": "Your cookie choices",
      "description": "Senior Service Manager (Internal applicants only) | University of Cambridge Sorry, you need to enable JavaScript to visit this website. Your cookie choices We use necessary cookies to make our site work. If you choose to accept optional cookies, it will help us understand your needs better and personalise what you see. Accept all cookies Decline optional cookies Choose your cookie mix Skip to main content View menu Study at Cambridge About the University Research at Cambridge Quick links For Cambridge students For staff For alumni For our\n              researchers Business and\n              enterprise Colleges and\n              Departments Give to Cambridge Libraries Museums and collections For Cambridge students For staff For alumni For our\n              researchers Business and\n              enterprise Colleges and\n              Departments Give to Cambridge Libraries Museums and collections For Cambridge students For staff For alumni For our researchers Business and enterprise Colleges and Departments Give to Cambridge Libraries Museums and collections Search Search site Home Study at Cambridge Undergraduate Undergraduate courses Applying Events and open days Fees and finance Postgraduate Postgraduate courses How to apply Postgraduate events Fees and funding International\n                students Continuing education Lifelong learning Courses in education Close About the University How the\n                University and Colleges work Term dates and calendars History Map Visiting the University News Annual reports A global university Equality and diversity Events Public engagement Jobs Give to Cambridge Close Research at Cambridge Close For Cambridge students For staff For alumni For our researchers Business and enterprise Colleges and Departments Give to Cambridge Libraries Museums and collections Breadcrumb Home Jobs Senior Service Manager (Internal applicants only) Jobs Menu Section - Jobs Jobs home Why Cambridge? Back to section home Why Cambridge? Why Cambridge? overview Pay and reward and employee benefits How to apply Back to section home How to apply How to apply overview Finding a role and applying online Inclusive recruitment Application tips Manage my applications Contact us Browse our vacancies Back to section home Browse our vacancies Browse our vacancies overview Academic vacancies Back to section home Academic vacancies Working as an academic at Cambridge Professional services vacancies Back to section home Professional services vacancies Working in professional services roles in Cambridge Professorships and Directorships vacancies Research vacancies Back to section home Research vacancies Working as a researcher at Cambridge Studentships Temporary employment service Search all University jobs College and affiliated institution jobs Life in Cambridge Back to section home Life in Cambridge Life in Cambridge overview Community and surroundings Getting around Relocating to Cambridge Back to section home Relocating to Cambridge Relocating to Cambridge overview Visas and immigration Right to work in the UK Accommodation and relocation support Search all University jobs Senior Service Manager (Internal applicants only) We are seeking an experienced and innovative Senior Service Manager to lead a multidisciplinary maintenance team delivering essential front-line responsive repair and maintenance services across a complex teaching, research and operational estate. This is a key leadership role focused on service responsiveness, operational performance and continuous improvement. You will lead a customer-focused team, drive service innovation and ensure critical facilities remain safe, operational and fully supported. Role Overview Based within the University's Estates Division Asset Management Team, you will lead the delivery and development of responsive maintenance services across a diverse estate, including advanced teaching laboratories and specialist research facilities.\nThe role combines strategic leadership with operational delivery, focusing on performance, innovation and stakeholder engagement to ensure services continue to meet evolving customer needs. Key Responsibilities Team Leadership Lead and develop a multidisciplinary technical team. Promote a culture of accountability, customer focus and continuous improvement.\nService Delivery Ensure responsive repair and maintenance services meet agreed performance standards. Drive a \"fix first time\" approach to improve efficiency and customer satisfaction. Monitor performance and implement improvements where required. Operational Leadership Provide calm and effective leadership during high-pressure situations. Maintain safe, reliable services with minimal disruption to teaching and research activities. Innovation and Service Development Review customer needs and service performance to identify improvement opportunities. Drive innovation, efficiency and continuous service development. About You You will have: Experience leading technical maintenance or facilities teams within a complex environment. A strong track record of improving service performance and customer outcomes. Experience driving service innovation and operational improvement. Excellent leadership, stakeholder management and communication skills. The ability to manage competing priorities and perform effectively under pressure. Click the 'Apply' button below to register an account with our recruitment system (if you have not already) and apply online. If you have any questions about this vacancy or the application process, please email Estates Division on EDR@admin.cam.ac.uk Please quote reference BA50487 on your application and in any correspondence about this vacancy. The University actively supports equality, diversity and inclusion and encourages applications from all sections of society. The University has a responsibility to ensure that all employees are eligible to live and work in the UK. Apply online Download further information Further Information - Senior Service Manager Key information Department/location Estates Division (Facilities) Salary £63,606-£67,468 Reference BA50487 Category Academic-related Date published 19 August 2026 Closing date 3 September 2026 Connect with us Facebook Instagram LinkedIn X YouTube © 2026 University of Cambridge Contact the University Accessibility Freedom of information Privacy policy and cookies Statement on Modern Slavery Terms and conditions University A-Z Study at Cambridge Undergraduate Postgraduate Lifelong learning Courses in education About the University How the University\n              and Colleges work Give to Cambridge Jobs Map Visiting the University Cambridge University Press & Assessment Research at Cambridge Research news About research at Cambridge Public engagement"
    },
