ck to section home How to apply How to apply overview Finding a role and applying online Inclusive recruitment Application tips Manage my applications Contact us Browse our vacancies Back to section home Browse our vacancies Browse our vacancies overview Academic vacancies Back to section home Academic vacancies Working as an academic at Cambridge Professional services vacancies Back to section home Professional services vacancies Working in professional services roles in Cambridge Professorships and Directorships vacancies Research vacancies Back to section home Research vacancies Working as a researcher at Cambridge Studentships Temporary employment service Search all University jobs College and affiliated institution jobs Life in Cambridge Back to section home Life in Cambridge Life in Cambridge overview Community and surroundings Getting around Relocating to Cambridge Back to section home Relocating to Cambridge Relocating to Cambridge overview Visas and immigration Right to work in the UK Accommodation and relocation support Search all University jobs Find out what makes the University of Cambridge like no other Home to pioneers whose work continues to change the world, and whose alumni have been recognised with 126 Nobel prizes. A global centre for technology, research and innovation, renowned for its start up and spin out successes. An outstanding academic reputation for intellectual freedom and brilliance, built over 800 years, and set against the backdrop of one of the world's most beautiful cities. Named as the UK’s top employer in the Financial Times' Best Employers list 2026, the University of Cambridge is like no other. Search all jobs: What's it like to work at the University of Cambridge? Browse our current vacancies Discover hundreds of academic, research and professional services roles on offer across the University and our 31 Colleges. Temporary Employment Service The University has its own Temporary Employment Service (TES), which offers temporary opportunities throughout the University. Why Cambridge? Find out what makes the University of Cambridge like no other. Learn about our mission and how we will support you. How to apply You can apply for most of our jobs online. Find out how – and how we can accommodate you. Life in Cambridge Stunning surroundings, modern amenities and a buzzing culture tucked together in a convenient and compact city make Cambridge a uniquely appealing place. Relocating to Cambridge We welcome the best talent from across the globe. Find out about our range of provisions to support you with your move to Cambridge. College and affiliated institution jobs Colleges and affiliated institutions are independent and autonomous. They appoint their own staff on their own terms and conditions of employment. Subscribe to a weekly email about new jobs Connect with us Facebook Instagram LinkedIn X YouTube © 2026 University of Cambridge Contact the University Accessibility Freedom of information Privacy policy and cookies Statement on Modern Slavery Terms and conditions University A-Z Study at Cambridge Undergraduate Postgraduate Lifelong learning Courses in education About the University How the University\n              and Colleges work Give to Cambridge Jobs Map Visiting the University Cambridge University Press & Assessment Research at Cambridge Research news About research at Cambridge Public engagement"
